                <li><b>Last Trains:</b> The evening return (5:10 PM from Leavenworth) offers a full day of activities before departure, but there is no later option - missing this train means overnighting in Leavenworth.</li>
                <li><b>Direct Service:</b> All Empire Builder trains run directly from Seattle to Leavenworth without transfers, making travel simple.</li>
