            <p>The Seattle → Leavenworth train journey is designed for comfort and relaxation:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Seating:</b> Spacious, adjustable, with good legroom and generous recline. Coach seats are comparable to first-class airline seating.</li>
                <li><b>Amenities:</b> Overhead storage, power outlets, and free Wi-Fi (available but can be intermittent in mountain terrain).</li>
                <li><b>Environment:</b> Quiet, especially in the upper level of bi-level coach cars.</li>
                <li><b>Scenery:</b> Enjoy spectacular views of the Cascade Mountains, Snohomish River Valley, Stevens Pass area, and the Wenatchee Valley. The Sightseer lounge car offers panoramic windows from both upper and lower levels - a highlight of the journey.</li>
