                <li><b>Location:</b> Edge of downtown Leavenworth, approximately 0.5 miles from the main village center (Front Street).</li>
                <li><b>Connectivity:</b>  Walking distance to downtown, local shuttles, taxis, and rideshare pick-up zones. Many hotels offer complimentary shuttle service.</li>
