            <ul>
                <li><b>Advance Booking:</b> Purchasing tickets days or weeks ahead often secures the lowest fares, especially for Coach seating. Empire Builder Coach fares can start as low as $35 with early purchase.</li>
                <li><b>Compare Fares: </b>Check both Coach and Sleeper options if you're considering a longer journey - sometimes Sleeper deals include meals that offset the higher price.</li>
                <li><b>Seating Choices: </b>Coach is generally the best value for the 3.5-hour Seattle-Leavenworth segment; Sleeper accommodations are not cost-effective for such a short trip.</li>
                <li><b>Amtrak Guest Rewards:</b> Sign up for Amtrak's loyalty program to earn points toward future travel on the Empire Builder or other routes.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Travel During Off-Peak Hours</h2>

            <ul>
                <li><b>Midweek Travel:</b> Tuesday and Wednesday departures are often less crowded and slightly cheaper than weekends.</li>
                <li><b>Avoid Peak Travel:</b> Weekends during Leavenworth's Christmas Lighting Festival (December-February), ski season, and summer hiking months often lead to higher prices and limited availability.</li>
                <li><b>Flexibility Helps:</b> Traveling outside festival weekends can reduce cost and provide a more relaxed environment with better seat selection.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Stay Flexible with Your Travel Plans</h2>

            <ul>
                <li>Adjusting your travel by a day or two can unlock cheaper options, especially during festival seasons.</li>
                <li>Flexibility may also improve seating availability in Coach.</li>
